==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn after 0.67 seconds<sup>20f</sup>, delay 19.33~22 seconds<sup>580f~660f</sup>.
*2 [[Those Guys]] spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 30~33.33 seconds<sup>900f~1,000f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Snache]] spawns as the boss.
**2 [[Baa Baa]]s spawn after 2 seconds<sup>60f</sup>, delay 12 seconds<sup>360f</sup>.
**2 [[Baa Baa]]s spawn after 8 seconds<sup>240f</sup>, delay 12 seconds<sup>360f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

